Appendix 'C'
Ambulance
Ambulance should have the following equipments:-
General :
- An wheeled stretcher with folding and adjusting devices; Head of the stretcher must be capable of being tilted upward;
- Fixed suction unit with equipments: Fixed oxygen supply with equipments;
- Pillow with case;
- Sheets; — Towels; Blankets;
- Emeis bag;
- Bed Pan:
- Urinal;
- Glass;
Safety equipments:
- Flares with life of 30 minutes;
- Flood lights;
- Flash lights;
- Fire extinguisher dry powder type: — Insulated gauntlets.
